 "remarks": "Downtown Norwalk Studio Apartment   Enjoy downtown living in this charming third-floor corner studio apartment at 94 Washington Street, Unit 12, Norwalk, CT. This bright, open-concept space features hardwood floors, high ceilings, large windows, and an efficient layout that makes the most of the living space.  The building offers secure key fob access and elevator service, providing added convenience and peace of mind. The apartment also features an in-unit washer and dryer.  Unbeatable location: Just a 2-minute walk to the train station, this apartment is ideal for commuters and anyone looking to enjoy the convenience of downtown living. Step outside to explore the restaurants, bars, cafes, and local businesses right in the neighborhood.  Apartment Features  Third-floor corner studio Bright, open layout with large windows Hardwood floors and high ceilings In-unit washer and dryer Secure building with key fob access Elevator access Convenient downtown location.  Optional parking pass: additional $90/month Heating & A/C are one window unit. Pets: Not permitted Smoking and vaping: Not permitted.   Enjoy Downtown Norwalk  Walk to the train, grab dinner or drinks nearby, and enjoy the convenience of having downtown amenities right outside your door. With easy access to Metro North train station, dining, nightlife, and local shopping, this studio offers a convenient, low-maintenance lifestyle in the heart of Norwalk.",
